        "sourceRef": "curricula/DE/Gymnasium/quality/goal-evidence/2026-10-10/chemie-q3-three-BW-practical-terminal-route-author-candidate-v1/tasks/three-whole-BW-practical-assessment-tasks.author.md",
        "extendedData": {
